#$ test: compile-fail
#$ rules: GRM-39
# `[GRM-39]` (ODR-070, D-331) — an operator chain is nested as deeply as it is
# long (`1 + 1 + … + 1` is a left-leaning tree): past the limit it is `E0112`
# too, from the type checker, which walks the tree the parser built without
# recursing.

